# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This technique has been used to lower the sampling cost of probabilistic error cancellation (PEC) for operator Loschmidt echo experiments with 56 qubits on an IBM Heron processor. [\\[2\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr "Teknik ini telah dipakai untuk menurunkan biaya sampling probabilistic error cancellation (PEC) pada eksperimen operator Loschmidt echo dengan 56 qubit di prosesor IBM Heron. [\\[2\\]](#references).\n"

